    <article class="narrow prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Cloud Community Spain is a non-profit association created by members of Spain’s AWS User Groups. We are technology professionals who volunteer time to organise open activities and strengthen the community.</p>
      <p>Our main work is supporting local User Groups and organising AWS Community Day Spain, the country’s annual AWS community gathering.</p>
      <h2>Our mission</h2>
      <p>We want to make cloud technology knowledge more accessible and create inclusive, independent and non-profit learning spaces.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Share technical knowledge through accessible talks, workshops and conferences.</li>
        <li>Connect professionals, students and people changing careers.</li>
        <li>Give visibility to local talent, new speakers and diverse perspectives.</li>
        <li>Support AWS User Groups with coordination, resources and legal cover.</li>
        <li>Use all income to support the association’s events and activities.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Our story</h2>
      <p>Spain’s AWS community has been meeting locally for more than a decade. In 2023, these communities joined forces to organise the first AWS Community Day Spain in Barcelona.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>2023 — Barcelona:</strong> first national edition, with more than 120 attendees.</li>
        <li><strong>2024 — Gijón:</strong> second edition, more than 200 attendees and sold-out tickets.</li>
        <li><strong>2025 — Zaragoza:</strong> third edition, nearly 200 attendees and 17 talks.</li>
        <li><strong>2026 — Santiago de Compostela:</strong> fourth edition and formal incorporation of Cloud Community Spain.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Our impact</h2>
      <p>Today we connect 12 AWS User Groups and a combined community of more than 10,000 members. We have created four Community Day editions and dozens of spaces to share knowledge, including first opportunities for new speakers.</p>
      <p>We do not rank groups: this impact belongs to the whole community and is built through collaboration.</p>
